                <li><b>Driving and Parking - </b>Multiple parking garages adjacent to terminals; economy lots with shuttle service; cell phone waiting lots for pickups</li>
                <li><b>Shuttle Services - </b>Hotel shuttles and private operators serving Strip properties and off-Strip resorts</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>Lounges at Harry Reid International</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>The Club at LAS (Terminal 1 and Terminal 3) - independent lounge accessible via Priority Pass, American Express, and day passes</li>
                <li>Delta Sky Club (Terminal 1)</li>
                <li>United Club (Terminal 1)</li>
                <li>American Airlines Admirals Club (Terminal 1)</li>
                <li>No traditional Southwest or Hawaiian lounges, though both offer priority boarding perks for elite members</li>
            </ul>
